Package: daggle
Title: R Interface to the Daggle DAG Scheduler
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("David", "Schoch", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "david@schochastics.net")
Description: Companion R package for daggle, a lightweight DAG scheduler for R.
    Provides in-step helpers for emitting outputs and reading metadata,
    plus API wrappers for triggering runs, checking status, and managing
    approval gates.
License: GPL-3
URL: https://github.com/cynkra/daggle-r
BugReports: https://github.com/cynkra/daggle-r/issues
